r border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">8. SADO二ツ亀ビューホテル（北部・二ツ亀）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.14</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/43904/43904.jpg\" alt=\"ＳＡＤＯ二ツ亀ビューホテル　＜佐渡島＞ 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜日本の快水浴場百選！巨岩「二ツ亀」を見下ろす大自然の絶景ホテル〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">秘境絶景旅、海水浴ファミリー、自然愛好家。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「佐渡最北端のダイナミックな海の絶景を独占するならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F43904%2F43904.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to